	"talks": [
		{
			"id": 4142201,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4142201
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4142201",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4142201,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 414220101,
					"content": "I have reached an understanding with Rhodeia.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220102,
					"content": "She is the most renowned of us Lochfolk scouts, and also the strongest. But she fled Fontaine, harboring a longing for the previous Hydro Archon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220103,
					"content": "I can no longer return to Fontaine myself, so let me tell you everything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220104,
					"content": "We Lochfolk once spread far and wide to rivers, streams, and ponds all over the continent, and we largely served as Fontaine's spies.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220105,
					"content": "Spies!? What's the Hydro Archon planning?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220106,
					"content": "The previous Archon had no plan to speak of. She merely wished to connect everyone in the world, in much the same way as all water is connected. But with her passing, many of us have cut off ties with Fontaine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220107,
					"content": "Like Rhodeia, the strongest of our number, they did not recognize the new Hydro Archon and desired only to keep the dreams of yesteryear alive. All Rhodeia wants is a small haven of tranquil waters.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220108,
					"content": "But she sensed my presence and believed me to be an assassin from Fontaine, and so she stretched forth her enmity, which turned the water bitter, in order to slay me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220109,
					"content": "But you were so small and weak when we first met. Did she really have to put in that much effort?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220110,
					"content": "The dominant mind of the Lochfolk can be very easily shattered if we come into contact with another smaller but wicked mind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220111,
					"content": "I admired Rhodeia a great deal, and so I piggybacked off a Hydro Slime and left Fontaine, jumping from water body to water body until I finally ended up here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220112,
					"content": "I doubt that any other Lochfolk would have shared my level of determination — unless, of course, they were an assassin on a mission.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220113,
					"content": "When you put it like that, it makes you sound pretty awesome...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220114,
					"content": "#Still, you can't beat Paimon, who's piggybacking on {NICKNAME}'s journey all over the seven nations and doing just fine so far!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220115,
					"content": "Oh, come off it, Paimon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 414220116,
					"content": "I have explained everything to her. The bitterness in the water should dissipate soon. She even asked if I wanted to join together with the waters of Qingce.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220117,
					"content": "So are you here to say goodbye?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220118,
					"content": "I still have one message to deliver. Please, accompany me to Springvale once more.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4142202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4142202
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4142202",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4142202,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Old Finch"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 414220201,
					"content": "Finch, Finch!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220202,
					"content": "Oh! You scared me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220203,
					"content": "Paimon's not surprised that you're surprised. Endora learns lightning quick, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220204,
					"content": "No, it's just that... The way you called my name, it sounded just like her...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220205,
					"content": "Oh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220206,
					"content": "\"With each small step a child takes, a journey through the world it makes. Drops of knowledge this creates, each one the child assimilates.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220207,
					"content": "\"Day by day, a child will age. Drop by drop, a life is made.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220208,
					"content": "I know this poem.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220209,
					"content": "Our lives and yours are very different. As such, we may never understand each other, even for so long as we may live.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220210,
					"content": "But our lives are also the same. We all flow towards the ocean, experiencing new things and encountering new opportunities along the way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220211,
					"content": "Thus, she says this: \"When the stars in the night sky have all gone out, and all streams and dreams have mingled in the same great ocean... Then, we will meet again.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220212,
					"content": "...I see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220213,
					"content": "Life flows on, so please, begin to move again. Do not stand still.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220214,
					"content": "Haha, that's her, alright. Still treating me like a kid, I see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220215,
					"content": "Alright then. I'd like a quiet moment to myself, if you would.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Old Finch"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220216,
					"content": "#Well, {NICKNAME}, guess we should head back and report to Connor, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4142203,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4142203
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
