			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Connor"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 414220301,
					"content": "Oh, you're here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Connor"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220302,
					"content": "I'm guessing that since it was you on the case, everything's been resolved and that's the end of it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220303,
						414220304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Connor"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220303,
					"content": "Naturally.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 414220305,
					"content": "The bitter water should be back to normal in a couple o' days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220306,
					"content": "I see, I see. It makes sense — even if you've removed the cause of the problem, it will still take some time for the water to cleanse itself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Connor"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220307,
					"content": "Well, I suppose I should inform the Adventurers' Guild that this case has been closed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Connor"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220304,
					"content": "There were some twists and turns...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220305
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4142204,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4142204
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4142204",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4142204,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 414220401,
					"content": "Our kind expresses love by merging water bodies together. This way, many minds can coexist without division.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220402,
					"content": "But understanding other life-forms in this world is not quite so simple. So we observe, study, imitate, and manifest in the form of animals. You could also say that their forms have become a part of us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220403,
					"content": "Seems like watching the river flow away has caused some deep thoughts to well up in Endora, huh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220404,
					"content": "I've never considered how I should live my life after this point. I always assumed that I would merge with Rhodeia, and that this would be good and right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220405,
					"content": "But Rhodeia seemed unhappy. She, too, understands that she is only waiting for pure waters to become corrupted.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220406,
						414220407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220406,
					"content": "So, what's your choice?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 414220408,
					"content": "Neither Rhodeia nor the one who dwells in Springvale wanted me to follow their paths. But surely they must have hated their lives in Fontaine still more.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220409,
					"content": "You guys are fascinating. Paimon's not sure what to say in this situation... But it's probably best to live in a way that makes you happy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220410,
					"content": "I've decided to embark on a path that no others before me have. Journeying with you has been a joyful experience, and I wish for all my future days to be just as joyful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220411,
					"content": "I wish to travel with you. Before this tiny stream of life flows into the ocean, I wish to see everything from the flowers that bloom on its banks to the clouds that sit on the horizon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220412,
						414220413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Endora"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220412,
					"content": "You're welcome to join us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 414220415,
					"content": "#Wait a minute, {NICKNAME}... Does this mean that the position of transcontinental travel companion is no longer a Paimon-only privilege?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220413,
					"content": "Wanna switch with Paimon?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 414220414,
					"content": "Hey!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 414220407,
					"content": "Is that why you refused her?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414220408
					]
				}
			]
		},
